      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This should be fixed on VRC's side, not by fixing the double vision but by disabling the post-processing anti aliasing entirely. The game uses MSAA already.\n\nIf they're so intent on removing doppler because of 2 or 3 worlds where you move very fast, where is the urgency in this, something that is far more game breaking?",
      "viewerReactions": null
