  "details": "Using the current version of the Post-Processing Stack on the Unity Asset Store, the Antialiasing feature is causing worlds to have double vision.\n\nMy unity project has been properly converted to 2017.4.15f1 and has the latest VRCSDK (2018.12.04.10.25)\n\nSee pictures for examples.\n\nEdit: Post-processing Stack v2 works fine. World creators that used anti-aliasing will have to switch to the beta version and reupload their world.",
